{"id":"d9039de00c55c4f2","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-fun-finite-support-function.md","title":"ZFC Fun Finite Support Function","display":"df-zfc-fun-finite-support-function — ZFC Fun Finite Support Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-fun-finite-support-function","aliases":["58-df-zfc-fun-finite-support-function"],"display":"df-zfc-fun-finite-support-function — ZFC Fun Finite Support Function","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-fun-finite-support-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-fun-finite-support-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-fun-finite-support-function — ZFC Fun Finite Support Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,X,Y,0_Y\\in V\">\\(f,X,Y,0_Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFunFiniteSupportFunction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFunFiniteSupportFunction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}finite\\text{-}support\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFunFiniteSupportFunction}_S(f,X,Y,0_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land0_Y\\in Y\\land\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq0_Y\\})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}finite\\text{-}support\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFunFiniteSupportFunction}_S(f,X,Y,0_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land0_Y\\in Y\\land\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq0_Y\\})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both functionality and the distinguished zero are typed; finite support is the finite nonzero locus, not topological support.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,X,Y,0_Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFunFiniteSupportFunction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}finite\\text{-}support\\text{-}function} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcFunFiniteSupportFunction}_S(f,X,Y,0_Y)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land0_Y\\in Y\\land\n\\mathrm{Finite}(\\{x\\in X:f(x)\\neq0_Y\\})","display":true}],"bytes":1052,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2136","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-fun-finite-support-function.md|58-df-zfc-fun-finite-support-function]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["d9a25b0ac94a3598","36d7463d215be751"]}